Soapbox generates derivative source from the Kubernetes project. Generated
repositories retain upstream copyright and attribution notices and include
file-level and package-level records describing relocation, rewriting,
pruning, patches, and source revisions.

Kubernetes is a project of The Linux Foundation. Kubernetes source is
available at https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes.
